## DEFERRED

- Mainnet upgrade of the four table canisters with this fix: operator lane. Covered by the already-queued 1790632499 ("The six mainnet backends run one reproducible build, and check-fleet-coherence exits 0", `lane: operator`), which redeploys the fleet from one build. No duplicate filed. Until it runs, a mainnet table whose posts leave every seat all-in still folds the big blind on its clock; a table upgraded while sitting in that state is healed by the clock guard on its next tick.

